{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2022-09-07 17:26:00', 'title': "AM BEST COMMENTS ON CREDIT RATINGS OF CVS HEALTH CORPORATION'S AETNA SUBSIDIARIES FOLLOWING ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF SIGNIFY HEALTH, INC.", 'text': "OLDWICK, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #INSURANCE--AM BEST HAS COMMENTED THAT THE CREDIT RATINGS (RATINGS) OF THE OPERATING ENTITIES OF AETNA INC. (AETNA), INCLUDING ITS RATED JOINT VENTURES, REMAIN UNCHANGED FOLLOWING THE ANNOUNCEMENT BY THEIR PARENT, CVS HEALTH CORPORATION (CVS HEALTH) (NYSE: CVS), ON SEPT. 5, 2022, THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE SIGNIFY HEALTH, INC. (SIGNIFY HEALTH), IN A TRANSACTION TOTALING APPROXIMATELY $8 BILLION. CVS HEALTH WILL ACQUIRE SIGNIFY HEALTH'S STOCK F"}